{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require paid AI subscriptions and use a levy to support displaced workers",
        "additional_details": "AI offers enormous benefits, but unrestricted free access can encourage excessive reliance on chatbots for everyday tasks and flood the internet with low-value synthetic images, videos and misleading content.\r\n\r\nWe believe modest fees and usage limits would encourage more considered use without banning the technology.\r\n\r\nAI-driven automation also threatens some jobs. We want a share of the industry's revenue to help fund income support and retraining for people affected.",
        "background": "Require consumer AI services, including chatbots and image, audio and video generators, to offer only paid access, with a minimum fee of around \u00a310 a month and reasonable usage limits. Introduce a levy on these services to fund Jobseeker's Allowance and support for workers displaced by AI.",
